<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<NPCCharacters>

  <!-- Custom Battle only (SubModule.xml registers this file for CustomGame, before the lords node).
       Each entry is a bare stub for a curated Custom Battle commander that TAOM builds from a vanilla
       SandBox lord in lords.xslt. SandBox registers its lords.xml for Campaign and CampaignStoryMode
       only, so in a Custom Battle those lords do not exist and the lords.xslt template has nothing to
       rebuild. The engine applies each node's XSLT to everything merged before it
       (MBObjectManager.CreateMergedXmlFile, v1.4.8 and v1.5.3), so lords.xslt turns each stub into the full
       character: name, race, face, skills and equipment all come from the template, none from here.
       The culture is repeated only because NPCCharacters.xsd requires the attribute.
       Add an id here only when custom_battle/custom_battle_commanders.json lists it and
       characters/lords.xml does not define it; CustomBattleLordStubsTests checks both. -->

